<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-month T-bill yield falls to 20.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-month T-bill yield falls to 20.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's twelve-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.51 percent, down from 21.46 percent at an auction in December, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	  14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received   28,408.25 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	 15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	    19,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.51 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     83.0969 pct</p>
</text>
